# ⚠️ This git repo is rooted at the user's HOME directory (C:\Users\Administrator).
# Blanket-ignore everything at the repo root and allowlist only the project dirs, so
# secrets/credentials (.ssh, .aws, .gitconfig, NTUSER.DAT, browser profile, etc.) can
# NEVER be accidentally staged (e.g. by `git add -A`). Already-tracked project files
# are unaffected (gitignore does not untrack).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/hustlecoin-cex/
# coin 三机分片/PG主从/监控 运维工具与文档(已脱敏:密码/加密钥打码)
!/coin-shard-tools/
!/phase2d_complete_report.md
!/validate_shard_config.py

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
*.log
backups/
# built SPA output — shipped to the server out-of-band, not tracked in git
# (mid-slash patterns are anchored to the repo root, so spell out the full path)
hustlecoin-cex/python-business/static/spa/
hustlecoin-cex/python-business/static/admin-spa/
hustlecoin-cex/python-business/static/dashboard.html
node_modules/
python-business/app/app/
python-business/engine/engine/
python-business/tests/tests/
